# Frontend Error Reporting

Errors that block the user flow and cannot be resolved automatically must be
reported to the user (usually `toast.error`) and to Sentry via `reportError`
from `nt-fe/lib/report-error.ts`.

Do not leave empty catches or `console.error`-only handlers for user-blocking
failures. Best-effort side effects after a successful primary action may omit
the toast, but still call `reportError`.
